flowchart TD
    Run[Run Project F5 or F6 on main scene] --> Config[project.godot main_scene unchanged]
    Config --> Main[main.tscn root instance of existing 3D scene]
    Main --> Preview[preview.gd ready]
    Preview --> Base[super ready: common main.gd controller]
    Base --> Session[One scene-owned GameSession and ordinary paused opening]
    Session --> Rear[Existing rear UI and gameplay owners]
    Session --> Field[Existing battlefield UI and gameplay owners]
    Preview --> World[Bind same simulation and manager to WorldPresenter]
    World --> HUD[3D character camera and existing world HUD]
    HUD --> Input[Player actions: E / Tab / build selection]
    Input --> Commands[Existing purchase and grid-placement commands]
    Commands --> Rear
    Rear --> Events[Existing state and keyed movement events]
    Events --> World
    HUD --> Stage1[Player checkpoint: people and materials arrive]
    Stage1 --> Stage2[Player checkpoint: place and manage a building]
    Stage2 --> Feedback[Dawson feedback before dependent factory stage]
